{"aligned_passages":[{"anchor":"qaoa-regularization","mapping_field":"claim_ids","mapping_ref":"sha256:af309f3a8460be4f12868d9deae92e9f84ec7fddc91b81a77167a172951f75ea/papers/long.json","paper_href":"/api/v1/papers/long?manifest=d826b3c0b6c6f35f589d1afa29d3242b77e2d2de8e4a7dea759ef7a436dc4989","passage_ref":"sha256:2b095aacecc1f5d7007325207b199a16856277bccf9cd83f2e5f52f0d81b6ef8/papers/long.md/sha256:af309f3a8460be4f12868d9deae92e9f84ec7fddc91b81a77167a172951f75ea/papers/long.json/passages/qaoa-regularization","query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=d826b3c0b6c6f35f589d1afa29d3242b77e2d2de8e4a7dea759ef7a436dc4989&paper=long&passage=qaoa-regularization","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=d826b3c0b6c6f35f589d1afa29d3242b77e2d2de8e4a7dea759ef7a436dc4989&paper=long&passage=qaoa-regularization","span":{"end_byte":133569,"end_line":3013,"start_byte":122720,"start_line":2810},"stage":"long"}],"lenses":{"consumers":"/api/v1/graph?manifest=d826b3c0b6c6f35f589d1afa29d3242b77e2d2de8e4a7dea759ef7a436dc4989&view=arguments&node=circuit.sign_smoothing&direction=consumers&assumptions=true","direct_passages":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=d826b3c0b6c6f35f589d1afa29d3242b77e2d2de8e4a7dea759ef7a436dc4989&node=circuit.sign_smoothing&relation=direct","prerequisite_uses":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=d826b3c0b6c6f35f589d1afa29d3242b77e2d2de8e4a7dea759ef7a436dc4989&node=circuit.sign_smoothing&relation=prerequisites","prerequisites":"/api/v1/graph?manifest=d826b3c0b6c6f35f589d1afa29d3242b77e2d2de8e4a7dea759ef7a436dc4989&view=arguments&node=circuit.sign_smoothing&assumptions=true"},"neighborhood_href":"/api/v1/neighborhood?manifest=d826b3c0b6c6f35f589d1afa29d3242b77e2d2de8e4a7dea759ef7a436dc4989&ref=sha256%3A05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0%2Fnodes%2Fcircuit.sign_smoothing","record":{"assumption_ids":["scalar.paper_minimizer"],"boundary":"The order is terminal cutoff, finite scalar mesh, then finite smoothing. The statement has no joint-limit or uniform-in-terminal-time rate and still allows unbounded intermediate columns.","citation_ids":["circuit-r2-26-cite-sign-smoothing"],"evidence_ids":[],"id":"circuit.sign_smoothing","kind":"claim","label":"Finite sign smoothing preserves the rooted value","locator":"03-classical-optimization.tex:220–254; eq:energy-l2-continuity, eq:scalar-near-optimal-smooth","source_id":"scalar-r2-26-source-qaoa-scalar","statement":"For a given minimizer, choose T<1 and then a sufficiently fine finite mesh N. At that fixed T,N, replace F_N=sgn(H_N) by tanh(kH_N). The independent final uniform-rounding coordinate gives P(H_N=0)=0, so this converges in L² as k→∞. For every error>0, finite T,N,k give a centered finite descendant output z with |z|≤1 and E(z)≥P_*−error; local maps are odd and smooth with polynomially bounded derivatives.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/circuit.sign_smoothing","relations":[{"derived":true,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/circuit.sign_smoothing","id":"field:9ee413b5d8dcbb4453af3a2b1914a0c42aee30e732d67235f5e4c14e8002d7bd","kind":"assumption_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/circuit.sign_smoothing","semantic_class":"explicit_assumption_reference","source_field":"assumption_ids","to":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/scalar.paper_minimizer"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/circuit.classical_fixed_minimizer","id":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22circuit.classical_fixed_minimizer%22%2C%22circuit.sign_smoothing%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22circuit.class